# Nesting Bot: "When this creature dies, create a 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature token." "Max speed — This creature
# gets +1/+0." (CR 702.178a) Cast on turn 1 it gives Bot1 speed 1 (CR 704.5aa, 702.179a) and is a 1/1; a Lightning Bolt to
